Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.02,0:00:01.06,Short,,0,0,0,,Your cat isn't sitting
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.06,0:00:01.90,Short,,0,0,0,,on your laptop
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.90,0:00:02.98,Short,,0,0,0,,to annoy you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.98,0:00:03.40,Short,,0,0,0,,It's sitting
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:04.28,Short,,0,0,0,,on a heater
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.64,0:00:05.56,Short,,0,0,0,,A laptop runs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.56,0:00:07.16,Short,,0,0,0,,as warm as your skin
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.16,0:00:08.38,Short,,0,0,0,,and cats feel best
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.38,0:00:09.10,Short,,0,0,0,,at temperatures
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.10,0:00:09.84,Short,,0,0,0,,that would make
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.84,0:00:10.62,Short,,0,0,0,,you sweat
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.97,0:00:11.62,Short,,0,0,0,,Their ancestors
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.62,0:00:13.22,Short,,0,0,0,,lived in the desert
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.22,0:00:14.26,Short,,0,0,0,,That's why it steals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.26,0:00:15.18,Short,,0,0,0,,your warm seat
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.18,0:00:16.48,Short,,0,0,0,,and follows the sunbeam
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.48,0:00:17.60,Short,,0,0,0,,across the floor
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.94,0:00:19.16,Short,,0,0,0,,There's a second reason
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.46,0:00:20.26,Short,,0,0,0,,The laptop is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.26,0:00:21.30,Short,,0,0,0,,where your eyes are
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.30,0:00:22.10,Short,,0,0,0,,all day
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.38,0:00:23.11,Short,,0,0,0,,To your cat
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.11,0:00:23.66,Short,,0,0,0,,it's the thing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.66,0:00:24.86,Short,,0,0,0,,stealing your attention
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.86,0:00:26.74,Short,,0,0,0,,so it sits right on it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.74,0:00:27.26,Short,,0,0,0,,And the keys
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.26,0:00:28.52,Short,,0,0,0,,smell like your hands
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.52,0:00:30.12,Short,,0,0,0,,So next time your cat
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.12,0:00:31.60,Short,,0,0,0,,lies on your keyboard
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.60,0:00:32.38,Short,,0,0,0,,don't push it off
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.38,0:00:32.63,Short,,0,0,0,,because
Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.40,0:00:28.30,Prompt,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,250)}Send this to someone\Nwhose cat sits on their keyboard
